OL,3,CEngland cricket captain Joe Root
OL,4,C'hacked off' over Brydon Carse incident
OL,6,FEngland cricket captain Joe Root said
OL,7,Fhe is "really hacked off" and
OL,8,F"disappointed" after Brydon Carse's
OL,9,Fnightclub drinking incident over the
OL,10,Fweekend.
OL,12,FPace bowler Brydon Carse was removed
OL,13,Ffrom the squad for this week's second
OL,14,FTest against Pakistan after he was
OL,15,Fdetained by police on suspicion of
OL,16,Fbeing drunk and disorderly outside a
OL,17,Fnightclub on Saturday night.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
