PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787753904
OL,3,CEngland cricket captain Joe Root
OL,4,C'hacked off' over Brydon Carse incident
OL,6,FCarse had been out celebrating
OL,7,FDurham's County Championship win over
OL,8,FDerbyshire alongside team-mates,
OL,9,Fincluding former England captain Ben
OL,10,FStokes and bowler Matthew Potts.
OL,12,FDerbyshire Police said he was released
OL,13,Fshortly after, when he agreed to leave
OL,14,Fthe area.
OL,16,FHe was subsequently cut by England for
OL,17,FThursday's match at Lord's, with an
OL,18,Finvestigation now under way by the
OL,19,Findependent Cricket Regulator.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
