OL,3,CEngland cricket captain Joe Root
OL,4,C'hacked off' over Brydon Carse incident
OL,6,FCarse is the latest in a growing list
OL,7,Fof contracted players who have been
OL,8,Finvolved in alcohol-related incidents
OL,9,Fin the past year.
OL,11,FIn June, shortly before he announced
OL,12,Fhis shock retirement, Ben Stokes was
OL,13,Finvestigated over a London nightclub
OL,14,Fincident involving him and team-mate
OL,15,FGus Atkinson.
OL,17,FWhite-ball captain Harry Brook was
OL,18,Fpunched by a bouncer in Wellington
OL,19,Flast October while drinking the night
OL,20,Fbefore a one-day international against
OL,21,FNew Zealand.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787753904
OL,3,CEngland cricket captain Joe Root
OL,4,C'hacked off' over Brydon Carse incident
OL,6,FThis latest incident with Carse broke
OL,7,Fjust days after England cricket
OL,8,Fcaptain Joe Root abolished the
OL,9,Fmidnight curfew for players to be in
OL,10,Ftheir accommodation.
OL,12,FReacting to the news of Carse's
OL,13,Fbehavior, Root said he was "really
OL,14,Fdisappointed", adding: "If I'm being
OL,15,Fbrutally honest, I'm really hacked
OL,16,Foff."
OL,18,FHe said Carse was "very upset, very
OL,19,Fapologetic and understands his
OL,20,Factions".
OL,26,@vD@XOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,308,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787753904
OL,3,CEngland cricket captain Joe Root
OL,4,C'hacked off' over Brydon Carse incident
OL,6,F"But it's not the isolated incident
OL,7,Fitself, it's the fact we continuously
OL,8,Fkeep making stupid mistakes away from
OL,9,Fthe game and it's detracting from what
OL,10,Fwe are doing on the field," Root added.
OL,12,FEngland cricketers are gaining a
OL,13,Freputation, and the captain admitted:
OL,14,F"It's not going to happen overnight,
OL,15,Fbut in many ways we are going to have
OL,16,Fto earn a lot of trust back."
OL,18,FRoot was against the idea of
OL,19,Freinstating a curfew for players.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@[O]vD@AOUxD@]O]
