PN,30707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1787753904
OL,3,CEngland cricket captain Joe Root
OL,4,C'hacked off' over Brydon Carse incident
OL,6,FEngland face Pakistan at Lord's on
OL,7,FThursday. Ahead of the match, Root
OL,8,Fsaid: "We know the individual
OL,9,Fbrilliance that lies within that team
OL,10,Fand what Pakistan are capable of
OL,11,Fcollectively.
OL,13,F"We also know that whenever we play
OL,14,Fanyone at Lord's, they generally raise
OL,15,Ftheir game. This group won't be taking
OL,16,Fanything for granted in that respect."
